    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Zumbi Blocks 2</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1941780/extras/8940ce739712b152eebe9e6a0e2cea87.poster.avif?t=1747671941\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1941780/extras/8940ce739712b152eebe9e6a0e2cea87.webm?t=1747671941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1941780/extras/8940ce739712b152eebe9e6a0e2cea87.mp4?t=1747671941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Zumbi Blocks 2 is a zombie survival game. It's going to be available for free while it's in early development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Much will change in terms of gameplay, as it will move towards a base building / wave survival type of game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Kill:</strong> fight zombies with melee and ranged weapons, both in <strong>first person</strong> or <strong>third person</strong> mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Loot:</strong> explore the <strong>procedurally generated city</strong>, to find resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Overcome:</strong> defeat <strong>bosses</strong> that live in interest points along the island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Upgrade:</strong> unlock loadout tiers, that you can bring to the match with you.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Zumbi Blocks 2</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1941780/extras/8940ce739712b152eebe9e6a0e2cea87.poster.avif?t=1747671941\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1941780/extras/8940ce739712b152eebe9e6a0e2cea87.webm?t=1747671941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1941780/extras/8940ce739712b152eebe9e6a0e2cea87.mp4?t=1747671941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Zumbi Blocks 2 is a zombie survival game. It's going to be available for free while it's in early development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Much will change in terms of gameplay, as it will move towards a base building / wave survival type of game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Kill:</strong> fight zombies with melee and ranged weapons, both in <strong>first person</strong> or <strong>third person</strong> mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Loot:</strong> explore the <strong>procedurally generated city</strong>, to find resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Overcome:</strong> defeat <strong>bosses</strong> that live in interest points along the island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Upgrade:</strong> unlock loadout tiers, that you can bring to the match with you.</p>",
    "short_description": "Loot. Kill. Survive. Can you escape ? (probably not) Zumbi Blocks 2 is the official sequel to the 2013 free browser zombie game. Stuck on an island, cut off from the rest of humanity, you wake up. The secret to breaking free from this place lies asleep, underground. From the soil, zumbies emerge.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Latin America<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
