        "minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or 11. (32 or 64 bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-7300 / AMD Ryzen 3 1300X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GT 1030 / AMD Vega 11<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Yes<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> No<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Believed to run game on 720p, lowest settings, at 60 FPS, most of the time.</li></ul>",
        "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or 11. (32 or 64 bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-2550K / AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 1050 Ti  / RX 570<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Yes<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> No<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Believed to run game on 1080p, highest settings, at 60 FPS, most of the time.</li></ul>"
